{"task_id": "HumanEval/128", "solution": "```python\ndef prod_signs(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of magnitudes of integers multiplied by the product of all signs\n    of each number in the array. Returns None for an empty array.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not arr:\n        return None\n\n    sum_magnitudes = sum(abs(num) for num in arr)\n\n    product_of_signs = 1\n    for num in arr:\n        if num == 0:\n            product_of_signs = 0\n            break\n        elif num < 0:\n            product_of_signs *= -1\n\n    return sum_magnitudes * product_of_signs\n```"}
